#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:3
#: 69a12548927b4a4682e46d25e6533ad3
msgid "永久分叉（Branch Fork）"
msgstr "Branch Fork"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:5
#: 83ec23a31d9f44d08098b6a5b48400f4
msgid "**分类：** 容器"
msgstr "**Category:** Containers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:7
#: 8947ccba0a1e4639a869e437a9f2dff0
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:9
#: 05c457aad1d244ce90b54ec3a6616f50
msgid "把同一份输入送入多条独立分支。每条分支可以继续串联多张卡，最后选择保留各自输出，或显式合并为一个数据集。"
msgstr ""
"Send the same input into multiple independent branches. Each branch can "
"contain its own sequence of cards. At the end, either retain the branch "
"outputs separately or merge them explicitly into one dataset."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:11
#: 62cc7549bebb43de8c35f59dac908e2a
#
msgid ""
"它与 [分支合并](card-group.md) 的区别是：`分支合并` 的同层子卡运行后立即合并；`永久分叉` "
"的每条分支可以先经过自己的多步卡片链。"
msgstr ""
"Unlike [Branch Merge](card-group.md), which merges sibling-card outputs "
"immediately after they run, `Branch Fork` lets each branch pass through "
"its own multi-step card chain first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:13
#: a299158daf0d487d8f05701cdc02d6f8
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:15
#: 996ebcb8f7894f2e81bfc38fde0d5877
msgid "设输入为 $D$，第 $i$ 条分支中的卡片链为 $F_i$："
msgstr "Let $D$ be the input and $F_i$ the card chain in branch $i$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:17
#: b57b52bdf1f047249ad75f6740070055
msgid ""
"\n"
"O_i = F_i(D),\\qquad\n"
"O_{\\mathrm{merge}} = O_1 \\mathbin{\\Vert} O_2 \\mathbin{\\Vert} \\cdots"
" \\mathbin{\\Vert} O_n.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:22
#: 5aba5a9f1b644522af47f90c6f19253b
msgid ""
"其中 $O_i$ 是分支输出，$\\Vert$ 表示按界面顺序拼接。独立输出模式保留各 $O_i$；合并模式生成 "
"$O_{\\mathrm{merge}}$。"
msgstr ""
"Here $O_i$ is a branch output and $\\Vert$ denotes concatenation in the "
"order shown in the interface. Separate-output mode retains each $O_i$, "
"while merge mode produces $O_{\\mathrm{merge}}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:24
#: cbdb2d3cb8d14ca9bf7097d0dbabe53e
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:26
#: f76f1cfc7a7e4700b64b99871458b4fc
msgid "输入 1 个结构，建立两条分支："
msgstr "Start with one input structure and create two branches:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:28
#: dc7092128ea84f618f5bc63b600f2254
msgid ""
"永久分叉\n"
"  ├─ A: 表面薄层扫描 → 原子扰动       → 6 个\n"
"  └─ B: 晶格应变 → 几何健全性过滤   → 4 个\n"
msgstr ""
"Branch Fork\n"
"  ├─ A: Surface Slab Scan → Atomic Perturb       → 6 structures\n"
"  └─ B: Lattice Strain → Geometry Sanity Filter   → 4 structures\n"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:34
#: fe8d1f3fe1634dc3bd292cfc1c83f895
msgid "选择“保留独立输出”时，得到 A、B 两份结果；选择“合并为一个输出”时："
msgstr ""
"Choose `Keep separate outputs` to obtain separate results for A and B. "
"Choose `Merge into one output` to obtain:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:36
#: 8c319d0a33cb4d3ea85459648772cd2b
msgid ""
"\n"
"|O_{\\mathrm{merge}}|=|O_A|+|O_B|=6+4=10.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:40
#: eab7c51a07d54e398a94eba75ac92369
msgid "卡片会直接显示 `A 6 + B 4 → 合并 10`。"
msgstr "The card displays `A 6 + B 4 → merged 10` directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:42
#: 7f8c77639d424184ab3a00c99eb1c081
msgid "界面操作"
msgstr "Using the Interface"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:44
#: b927ba293d354f00a33595eb4bcf2718
msgid "点击分支空白区选中目标分支，再从卡片库添加卡片。"
msgstr ""
"Click an empty area in a branch to select it, then add a card from the "
"card library."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:45
#: 3ec67618a8ef4f6498c5a7978dc14b66
msgid "在分支名称输入框中直接改名；名称会随工作流配置保存。"
msgstr ""
"Rename a branch directly in its name field. The name is saved with the "
"workflow configuration."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:46
#: 8e741594548f41deb0eb44819e0020d6
msgid "使用“添加分支”增加分支；一个永久分叉最多三条。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Add branch` to create another branch. One Branch Fork supports at "
"most three branches."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:47
#: a5d798ab26b34631806d64dd14367c5f
msgid "选择“保留独立输出”或“合并为一个输出”，再运行工作流。"
msgstr ""
"Choose `Keep separate outputs` or `Merge into one output`, then run the "
"workflow."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:49
#: d53fc365d24c4c02a97810cdb141db1b
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:51
#: 56decc3d74b140a8bf3f6406e03b00db
msgid "分支（branches）"
msgstr "Branches (branches)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:53
#: 9d7bd0e539224902b7e96cb6ca3946d2
msgid "分支列表。每条分支保存稳定 `id`、显示名称、启用状态和内部卡片顺序。不同分支始终从同一份 Fork 输入开始。"
msgstr ""
"List of branches. Each branch stores a stable `id`, display name, enabled"
" state, and internal card order. Every branch always starts from the same"
" Fork input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:55
#: d464989130e845dd96931fbc5a5a09fa
msgid "显式合并（merge）"
msgstr "Explicit Merge (merge)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:57
#: 8b5ce3aeddd9466ca2080c0b4ca88d95
msgid "布尔值，默认 `false`。"
msgstr "Boolean, default `false`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:59
#: 3649777812564229bfdc257106cb58f5
msgid "`false`：每条分支保留自己的最终输出；Fork 后不能连接共同下游卡片。"
msgstr ""
"`false`: Each branch retains its own final output. A shared downstream "
"card cannot be connected after the Fork."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:60
#: bf24b60d4dfc4cc9a9a215f2e77c4e21
msgid "`true`：所有启用分支成功后，按分支顺序拼接输出；拼接结果成为后续卡片输入。"
msgstr ""
"`true`: After every enabled branch succeeds, concatenate their outputs in"
" branch order. The concatenated result becomes the input to downstream "
"cards."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:62
#: 90aa95879f1d4639848caab31e9feb90
msgid "`Merge` 只拼接，不去重或筛选。"
msgstr "`Merge` only concatenates outputs; it does not deduplicate or filter them."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:64
#: 954fe77024124e68a117e1c47b0fe125
msgid "失败与停止语义"
msgstr "Failure and Stop Behavior"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:66
#: 0861f4c7c99a4bcba11cc3416fa4fd66
msgid "启用的分支必须至少包含一张启用卡片，否则会在运行前提示具体分支。"
msgstr ""
"Every enabled branch must contain at least one enabled card. Otherwise, "
"the specific branch is reported before the workflow starts."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:67
#: 6b1730c026ef47aaa23d06d4e9bafd99
msgid "独立输出模式下，一条分支失败不会删除其他成功分支的输出；卡片显示“部分完成”。"
msgstr ""
"In separate-output mode, failure in one branch does not remove outputs "
"from other successful branches; the card reports `Partially complete`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:68
#: 43bf2a71d8074040a6d50587392e0490
msgid "合并模式下，任一启用分支失败都会阻止 Merge 和共同下游。"
msgstr ""
"In merge mode, failure in any enabled branch prevents the merge and "
"blocks the shared downstream path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:69
#: f3497bba23c64ed5907709061e2e378f
msgid "停止工作流会停止所有仍在运行的分支卡片；部分结果不会冒充成功输出。"
msgstr ""
"Stopping the workflow stops every branch card that is still running. "
"Partial results are not presented as successful outputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:71
#: 728e64824bc646d5a9bf670eadfbba28
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:73
#: c19c3738ce0e442da47e82729a171a53
msgid "**为什么不能连接共同下游？** “保留独立输出”没有唯一输出；先切换到“合并输出”。"
msgstr ""
"**Why can I not connect a shared downstream card?** `Keep separate "
"outputs` has no single output. Switch to merged output first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:75
#: 7486d76cda34408f8071fee8b2c8e410
msgid "**为什么运行前提示空分支？** 启用的分支必须包含至少一张启用卡片；添加卡片或关闭该分支即可。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is an empty branch reported before the run?** An enabled branch "
"must contain at least one enabled card. Add a card or disable that "
"branch."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:77
#: e5ecf0b6c5d84c759178294af3dee16a
msgid "保存字段"
msgstr "Saved Fields"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:79
#: dbfc17e46d7343e796a6d2150a252d48
msgid "`branches`：各分支的 `id`、名称、启用状态和卡片列表。"
msgstr "`branches`: Each branch's `id`, name, enabled state, and card list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:80
#: 92b0020040764056ba6f8e4a9f4a9bb0
msgid "`merge`：是否显式合并输出。"
msgstr "`merge`: Whether to merge branch outputs explicitly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/workflow-fork.md:82
#: 949e195e9815487e9110baa0c3b019d6
msgid "旧配置中的类名 `WorkflowFork` 和旧显示名称仍可加载。"
msgstr ""
"The legacy class name `WorkflowFork` and legacy display names in existing"
" configurations can still be loaded."
